    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/54f80512-5ec4-43f2-9ef3-af4478b9dffe-image.png\" style=\"width: 370px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;Sharp points are at&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Set of non-differentiable points of function are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> which is a subset of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
